{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"让想靠近的念头留下来、重新尝到亲近的快乐，都属于心理状态及其变化，没有把珠子里的比喻写成真实行动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"重新确认自己曾真心替对方高兴、修正对先前体贴的判断，均有 S05-2、S05-3 的前文依据，也没有新增具体往事或人物关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"知道回应不能由自己决定、没有得到保证、仍怕落空，都是对既有不确定感的延续，没有越界添加外部事件。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S10-2 已说他不再压住靠近的念头、忍着的喜欢终于能出来，直接解释了为何此时愿意让喜欢留下并重新感到快乐。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-1 说明他能从安心靠近和真心对人好中获得满足，为亲近的快乐重新出现提供了持续有效的心理基础。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S03-3 能解释他为什么想被珍惜，却不能单独解释他为什么重新相信自己先前的体贴是真心。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S05-2 是他曾怀疑自己对人好是在等回报的旧判断，S11-2 则明确写出了对这一判断的修正。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S05-3 已指出他替对方高兴时确实真心快乐，这正是他不再把先前体贴全看成索取回报的理由。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S03-2 已说明他不能替对方决定是否珍惜自己，因此即使重新高兴，也无法消除对回应落空的担心。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S09-2 解释了他为何不愿逼对方回应，却只能间接说明不确定性为何持续，不能直接解释高兴时仍怕落空。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S10-1 已明确他对对方是否主动靠近没有把握、仍同时保留盼望和顾虑，直接支撑了此处的担心，但与本条前半有重复。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"三条依次写出允许喜欢留下、重新确认自己的真心、仍然害怕落空，心理变化连贯，不看珠子也能理解。 \",\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R49\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"丢掉了「犹疑这么久仍能高兴，反让他感动」这一层：修补后写的是重新确认体贴真诚所带来的满足，并未写出他因历经犹疑仍然能够快乐而感动自己。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S11-3\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"「对方会不会回应不是自己能定的、也没得到新的保证」重复了 S03-2、S10-1 已交代的不确定性；本条真正新增的是高兴时仍怕落空，前提可以压缩。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "98bed3f1-f7b1-48a5-a925-710eb7883f50", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T101822322040Z", "elapsed_seconds": 405.484, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T10:25:07.822468+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9d06008662d6512458ef7cb81ff74dc84750f7b3885324c7abfa23d969dfb639", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T101822322040Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "b2c388f82fe0b5de1097297a6ac2ddf58143dd71d631680159da89b08c1d1e2b"}}}
